msgstr "Pelin muisti"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6746
msgid ""
"4 GB even for a game not made for it: room for mods; Auto if it misbehaves"
msgstr ""
"4 Gt myös pelille, jota ei ole tehty sille: tilaa modeille; Automaattinen, "
"jos peli oireilee"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6747
msgid "2 GB, or 4 GB for a game made for it, as on Windows"
msgstr "2 Gt, tai 4 Gt sille tehdylle pelille, kuten Windowsissa"

#. A menu row's value, shown at its right: keep it short (about 15 characters).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:6748
msgid "4 GB"
msgstr "4 Gt"

#. A menu row's name (about 30 characters fit).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:6751
msgid "Graphics memory"
msgstr "Grafiikkamuisti"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6753
msgid "All 8 GB: the game may take memory the rest of it needs"
msgstr "Kaikki 8 Gt: peli voi viedä muistia, jota muu järjestelmä tarvitsee"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6754
msgid ""
"More for the game's textures, less for the rest; Auto if it runs out of "
"memory"
msgstr ""
"Enemmän pelin tekstuureille, vähemmän muulle; Automaattinen, jos muisti "
"loppuu"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6755
msgid ""
"4 GB, so the game leaves room for the rest: the console's memory is shared"
msgstr "4 Gt, jotta peli jättää tilaa muulle: konsolin muisti on jaettua"

#. A menu row's value, shown at its right: keep it short (about 15 characters).
